window.products.push({"id":682089,"name":"SHARNDY Towel Warmer with Built-in Timer ETW13CS for Bathroom Wall Mounted Bath Towel Heater Plug-in Electric Heated Towel Rack Brushed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":213.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m2tm61z+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SHARNDY TOWEL WARMER】SHARNDY towel warmer is made of durable 201 stainless steel with brushed finished, easy to clean and without worrying about any rust issues. Using a towel warmer can shorten the wet state of the towel, effectively avoid odor, reduce the number of towel cleaning, increase the service life of the towel, and bring you a healthy and sanitary living enviroment. 【TEMPERATURE & TIME CONTROLLER】SHARNDY towel warmer carries the latest built-in visual temperature and time control switch that enables you to control the heating temperature and time based on individual requirement. Heating temperature can be adjusted between100°F and 140°F in 10°F increment. Heating time can be adjusted between 1H and 8H in 1H increment or be not limited. Intelligent design makes the towel heater easier to use and saves you time and energy. 【SAFE & FAST HEATING】SHARNDY towel warmer uses ergonomic alloy heating wires technology. After you turn on the towel warmer, you will feel warm about 5 minutes and reach working temperature displayed by the LED display screen within 10~20 minutes. Towel warmer comes with built-in Temp Smart overheat protection to prevent the unit’s surface temperature from exceeding, ensures safety, far away from excessive temperatures. 【ENERGY & SPACE-SAVING】SHARNDY towel warmer has a very low consumption rate and is designed to run 24 hours a day. Use electric to produce zero pollution and an economical heat output costs less, an affordable alternative to traditional dryers. Size: H26.77\" x W20.47\" x D4.33\". Wall mounted design saves space and maximizes your floor space. It is very lightweight, so there is no requirement for wall bearing and no pressure on the wall. 【GUARANTEE & CUSTOMIZE】Shipping within 24 hours, 3 Years warranty. All necessary accessories are included in the package, and it is very easy to install with our manual. Any problem after receiving the goods, please feel free to contact us immediately, our experienced customer service team will response in 24 hours. If you want to customize the towel warmer, please feel free to click \"Warm Partner\" to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51m2tm61z+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHARNDY","source_asin":"B093GXG5CT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093GXG5CT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093GXG5CT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":682090,"name":"COSTWAY Evaporative Air Cooler, Portable 3-in-1 Air Cooler with Remote Control, 60° Oscillation, 2 Ice Crystal Boxes, 8-Hour Timer, Ultra Quiet Bladel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ffsKKKl9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3 in 1 Air Cooler Fan】 In addition to being a ordinary bladeless fan, it can also serve as a humidifier or a air cooler when you add water or ice packs to bring you cold effect. You can enjoy your hot summer days with our air cooling fan! 【3 Wind Speeds & 3 Modes】Featuring 3 wind speeds (high/medium/low) and 3 operating modes (normal/cooling/sleep), this portable air cooler allows you to customize your desired airflow and cooling effects easily, such as powerful cooling air for workout or peaceful breeze for sleeping. All to your wishes! 【Enjoy Cooling Summer】Equipped with washable air filter and plant fiber ice curtain, this evaporative air cooler is bringing cooling air to your room. Additionally, the 60° up and down oscillation (manual adjustment) and 120° left and right oscillation (automatic adjustable) ensure wide range wind supply. 【Remote Control & LED Display】Equipped with a remote control, you can control the air cooler without leaving bed or sofa. And the icon on the remote and touch panel is clear and easy to understand, the seniors who are not familiar with smart appliances can also easily operate. Moreover, designed with tiny grid, the cooler keeps children from sticking their fingers in. 【Quiet Operation & Built-in 8H Timer】This powerful swamp cooler blows comforting air-flow with less than 45dB noise, providing you with a quiet working or sleeping environment. Besides, the LED screen will automatically turn off after 3 minutes in no operation and the built-in timer allows you to set the auto-off time from 1-8 hours. No worry about forgetting to turn it off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ffsKKKl9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B0B3LMR58T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3LMR58T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3LMR58T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
