window.products.push({"id":682149,"name":"Genteen Overnight Oats Containers with Lids, Yogurt Parfait Cups with Lids Snack Containers with Topping Cereal or Overnight Oats Container Ideal for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X5zoRRezL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Bulit In Ice Pack Design】Overnight oats containers is designed with removable cooling ice-pack to keep food fresh and tasty for a long time to mealtime, even in Summer. It's a great choice for your family, husband and wife. 【Nothing Get Mess】Genteen ensures the security of your food by making these oatmeal container airtight with three buckles lid and sealing ring. It provides leak-proof safety while taking them on the go. Enjoy your food anywhere with these portable containers. Our three buckles lip with sealing ring . 【BPA Free】The Genteen snack container is made of safe food grade PP plastic, 100% BPA-free, and can be safely used in dishwashers, microwaves and refrigerators. ⚠Note: Do not put ice pack in high-temperature equipment to ensure normal use. 【Muti-use Small Food Storage Containers】Our oatmeal containers aren't just limited to overnight oatmeal storage, but you can also use them to store all kinds of food. Perfect for cereal, granola, muesli, blueberry, blackberry, strawberry with milk or yogurt. Business Professionals, Travelers, Students, Body builders, Dieters will love this. 【On-the-Go Design】Our snack containers are using this travel-friendly solution. Whether you go to work, school, camping, or stay on track with your fitness and nutrition goals, you can eat the tasty cereal and snacks wherever you go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X5zoRRezL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Genteen","source_asin":"B0BNQFNP9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQFNP9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQFNP9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":682150,"name":"Reusable Grocery Bags, 2 Pcs Foldable Shopping Bags Heavy Duty Grocery Totes Bag (Navy Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ryGei0UGS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Non-woven,Nylon 【Larger Capacity & Durable】These eco-friendly reusable grocery bags are made of heavy-duty non-woven water resistant fabric reinforced. It can hold up to 50+ pounds of groceries and replaces 2-3 conventional grocery bags. And these foldable reusable grocery bags are reinforced with bias tape which makes them hold heavy loads safely. Long handles of the foldable shopping bags allow for hand holding or carry on the shoulder for easier carrying. 【Rip-Stop Fabric & Waterproof 】These grocery shopping bags are made of 100% RIP-STOP nylon cloth,which is lightweight yet sturdy and resistant to rips and water. It can withstand daily wear and tear, you don't have to worry that the reusable tote bags will be going to rip from carrying too much. These grocery shopping totes are very easy to clean. Just throw the reusable bags in the washing machine. It is strong enough to pack heavy groceries, like canned goods, gallons of milk. 【Easy to Fold & Portable 】Our reusable grocery bags can be easily wrapped into a small roll ,you just need to pull and roll to fold,which takes up hardly any space that can easily fit in a backpack, purse, pocket or the glove box of the car. You will always have reusable bags with you whether you stop by a store on whim or have an unplanned shopping trip,and help reduce plastic pollution. 【Suitable for Most Occasions】The foldable grocery bags are fashion so excellent for daily supplies when you need for a trip or birthday party gift, Halloween, Christmas day, holiday, grocery store, supermarket, etc. For example, enterprises can distribute these lightweight shopping bags to employees or give them to consumers during activities. Keep folded shopping totes in your handbag and car for emergencies or outdoor activities. 【 Washable& Resuable】 The shopping tote bag’s special fabric is easy to clean. Toss these collapsible shopping bags right into the washer and let bag air dry, saving your time.To give earth a green and healthy future, and live an eco-friendly life by using reusable shopping bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ryGei0UGS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ILAVCOOL","source_asin":"B0924LWVTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0924LWVTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0924LWVTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
