window.products.push({"id":682286,"name":"Air Fryer 6 QT Airfryer XL Oilless Cooker with 50 Recipes Cookbook for Rotisserie, Roast, Preheat, Bake, One Touch Screen with 11 Cooking Functions an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MjSKTTcKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kill Calories, Live Healthier: Air Fryer uses hot air circulation to cook food – that would otherwise be submerged in oil – to reduce 95% of oil and calories, while preserving the crispy texture of food, so you can eat without guilt 11-in-1 Appliance & Space Saver: The air fryer oven offers 11 preset menus with precise time and temperature controls to cook or reheat food quickly; comprising of a deep fryer, oven, frying pan, toaster, sandwich maker, defroster, microwave oven, you can reclaim valuable counter space with our multifunctional air fryer Quicker, More Even Results: Troubled by long cooking times? Food is cooked 20% faster thanks to the powerful 1750W built-in fan and 360° air convection system, optimized to slash cooking time more than non-convection ovens, and to free your hands to work on other dishes Chef Crash Course: Our air fryer is beginner-friendly with the one-key setting and a cookbook containing 50 popular recipes, amateur cooks can easily make toast, bacon, pancakes, French fries, sausages, chicken, steak, turkey, and satisfy whatever you and your family is craving – without hesitation Dishwasher Safe & Easy to Clean: A Teflon layer (a material with a high melting point to protect the basket) coats the detachable basket to ensure hassle-free cleaning by simply putting in the dishwasher (tip: make sure the basket is cool prior to cleaning to avoid damage and distortion)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MjSKTTcKS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAOAO","source_asin":"B09CGRS8FX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CGRS8FX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CGRS8FX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
