window.products.push({"id":682460,"name":"Souvia Commercial Sous Vide Immersion Circulation, Bundle with Cooking Water Balls – Stainless Steel – 100% BPA Free – Easy to Use Digital Control Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pZV2d1IsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This complete sous vide cooking set allows you to feel like a celebrity chef in your own home!Immersion Circulator Machine together with Food Grade Cooking Balls create meals that will leave your family and friends begging for more. Sous Vide Cooking for Healthier, Nutritious & Flavorful Food! Cooking food in a vacuum ensures that all the natural juices and vitamins are retained, without being boiled or steamed away.It also means you can cook without adding any extra oils and fats, which means healthier and lower calories meals for your family. Gourmet Dishes made simple and NO Cleanup Cooking gourmet food has never been easier when using sous vide machine.Cooking at precise temperatures allows you to make a perfect Crème Brulee, delectable desserts, and succulent melt-in your mouth meat.The best part of all this is - NO pots to scrub, plates to wash or burnt food to scrape off your grill pan. Specifications and Features: 💧 2 in 1 Set- Immersion Circulator and Cooking Balls💧 BPA Free Water Bath Balls💧FREE Net Drying Bag💧Sous Vide Water Bath Temperature Can be Set From 41°F to 210°F 💧Device Can Be Programmed to Cook Between 1- 99 Hours. 💧LCD Smart Memory Function Screen💧Anti-Dry Safety Protection Device💧Light and Portable – 4.4 lb.💧Rapid Heating Time💧Powerful Water Circulator- 7.5 Liter per min. Cooking with Plastic Balls Will Save you MONEY This device will use very little electricity compared to most of your kitchen appliances, and the plastic balls keep your pot or container insulated so it uses even less energy.You also don’t need to purchase special lids to fit your sous vide containers.The balls act as a lid for any container; as steam rises it bounces off the hard cooking balls and condenses right back into the vessel.Leave your water bath machine on for hours at a time with no more worrying about water evaporating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pZV2d1IsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magic Mill","source_asin":"B07JNV44YC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JNV44YC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JNV44YC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
