window.products.push({"id":682565,"name":"Jaipur Living Daytona Natural Fiber Solid Neutral Area Rug (3' X 5')","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1eSZ9WAxvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jaipur Naturals Sanibel Naturals Solid Pattern Taupe/Tan Sisal Area Rug 3x5 made with 100% Sisal. Woven 100% of natural sisal, these rugs are durable and latex backed. (1) professional cleaning recommended, (2) vacuum regularly to keep dirt from getting trapped in the fibers, (3) do not steam clean or wet as natural fibers are highly absorbent and may cause shrinkage, (4) suction cleaning or dry extraction cleaning is recommended, (5) avoid direct sunlight to prevent fading, (6) air dry, but do not hang as to not stretch fibers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1eSZ9WAxvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jaipur Living","source_asin":"B00N9DUMCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N9DUMCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N9DUMCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
