window.products.push({"id":682849,"name":"90\"/Almost 8ft (Black or White) Floating Wall Shelf / Ledge - Picture & Art Display (Solid Wood)(White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YNSXPG9EL._AC_.jpg","description":"Buyer receives (1) Modern ledge/shelf - Easily display your pictures, artwork, small ornamental articles, keepsakes & more. ****Custom sizes & colors are available. E-mail specifications for pricing.**** Product Dimensions :Length: 7 1/2ft-90\" / Total Depth: 4\" (2-1/2\" usable space) - Max load: 25 lbs Did you know? The shelves use routed keyhole slots for mounting, this eliminates drilling through the face of the item. Due to the variances in wall construction the anchors are not included, however you can get the appropriate anchors at your local hardware store. (please note: improper installation of anchors can effect weight capacity) Product materials : Made from pine wood. DOES NOT CONTAIN - fiberboard, MDF or particle board, pine is a much sturdier product than these other options.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YNSXPG9EL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Othacity","source_asin":"B00X10XLXO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00X10XLXO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00X10XLXO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":682850,"name":"Decorative Magnets 7 Small Live Love","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41u7DS9ijvL._AC_.jpg","description":"Brighten up your home, office, locker and more with these decorative magnets. These colorful magnets have a clear dome gem highlighting a 3/4 inch image. These are both eye catching and functional. The magnets are great for refrigerators, notice boards, cubicles, bulletin boards or anywhere else you use magnets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41u7DS9ijvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Auntie Moo's","source_asin":"B008CLUMQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682850","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008CLUMQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008CLUMQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":682851,"name":"Waterfall Tapestry - Jungle Nature Water Beautiful Wall Hanging Décor Tapestries Art - Large 68 H x 80 W inches - W.Francis American Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813D1U9juGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Congratulations!!! You've just a discovered a custom designed Waterfall Wall Tapestry from W.Francis American Made. About W.Francis American Made: W.Francis American Made is a print design firm based in North Carolina, USA. At W.Francis we love Wall Tapestries. Allot. So much so that we're happy to spend our days tinkering designs so you can enjoy our wall tapestries as much as we do. All of our Wall Tapestries are designed digitally which allows us to play with colors, layouts and edges, all with the aim to create the perfect piece just for you. Once we're happy with the digital design, it is printed onto high quality fabric, packed and shipped to your door from NC, USA. Material Detail: Each tapestry is made from a 100% polyester material which is specifically designed for high quality images. Its finished with expertly hemmed edges. Easy to Wash and Iron: Machine or hand wash with cold water on a gentle cycle. Hang dry only in the shade. Iron the non printed side on a low temp to remove creases. Easy to Hang: This Waterfall tapestry is easy to hang by using decorative tacks, push pins, thumbtacks, command strip or Velcro tapes. Four Sizes Available: 4 size options: Small - 26\" x 36\", Medium - 51\" x 60\", Large - 68\" x 80\" or Giant - 88\" x 104\" (inches) - Refer to image and option selection for orientation. Notes: There may be a slight color difference due to the monitor and color settings of the device which you are viewing this listing on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813D1U9juGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B098LDS67M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098LDS67M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098LDS67M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":682852,"name":"!RAKRISA 50 Pcs 4.7 x 8.6 Inch Stand Up Zip Lock Resealable Aluminum Mylar Foil Plastic Packaging Bags| 8 Mil Thick Heavy Duty Heat Sealable Smell Odo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rnIDMEVTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Rakrisa we bring amazing values at low prices. Our bags are composed of premium quality 4 mil thick transparent front plus 4 mil thick aluminum foil back,  which allows them to be waterproof and moisture-proof. The versatile usage of these bags are endless, which makes them a household must have item. FAQs Does these bags holds in the scent? Absolutely. Our bags comes with two types of sealing. One involving sturdy ziplock and another involving heat sealing.  These dual seals locks in all of the air of the content inside the bags. Are these pouches reusable? Yes. Our bags are designed to be used repetitively without any notches and tears. Can I heat seal these bags? Yes you can. You do not necessarily need a heat sealer to seal the top of the bags. You can use your hair straightener or flat iron. Can these bags hold liquid? Or powder? Yes. How can I personalize these bags? You can print on these bags or use adhesive labels. Specifications: Size: 4.7 x 8.6 inches  Quantity: 50 pieces 18 Months Warranty & 100% Money-Back Guarantee We strive to provide our customers with the awesomest experience ever. If for any reason, you don't absolutely love your bags, just message us and we'll refund your order in full. Absolutely no questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rnIDMEVTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"!RAKRISA","source_asin":"B07WDN9MML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-682852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WDN9MML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WDN9MML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
